{"title":"나 홀로 버그로 꿀빠는 플레이어","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bRuhNi/hAFrQvcgR9/851qH2S2KKKqb2RDuVK4wk&filename=th3","synopsis":"과도한 업무와 밤샘 게임으로 돌연사?!\n눈을 뜬 나를 반긴 것은 게임 <파라디소>의 세계관 속이었다.\n\n그것도 초고도비만의 몸뚱이와 몰락하기 일보직전의 완벽한 듣보잡 엑스트라 영주. 자레드의 몸으로 환생했다!\n\n망할! 소설이나 영화 속 주인공들은 존잘남으로 태어나서 호의호식하며 잘 살던데!\n\n“반드시 정점을 차지하겠어!”\n\n성공하고 성장 할 수 있다면!\n버그든 꼼수든 무엇이든 OK!\n\n자레드의 혹독한 다이어트와 버그로 꿀빠는 치열한 현생 도전기가 시작된다!\n\n* 원작소설 <나 홀로 버그로 꿀빠는 플레이어>","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":143,"change":{"type":"up","amount":69}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":179,"change":{"type":"down","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":156,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":198,"change":{"type":"down","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":177,"change":{"type":"up","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":154,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":292,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":199,"change":{"type":"up","amount":93}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":218,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":200,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":217,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":203,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":216,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":211,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":194,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":202,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":210,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":219,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":264,"change":{"type":"down","amount":46}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":271,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":231,"change":{"type":"up","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":227,"change":{"typ